      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Ilya calls ECHO-73 a diagnostics node, but the first scan states only show how its ports responded. Identify the open port that the scan flags for service review without claiming what runs there yet.",
      "taskInstructions": "Run <b>nmap -sS 10.42.18.73</b> in the terminal and read the open ports it reports.",
      "taskQuestion": "Which TCP port does the scan flag for service review?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Correct. TCP/8080 is open and needs service identification before we describe what it exposes.",
